{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Roanoke S3","Roanoke Season 3","roanoke-s3"],"channel":{"category":"🌅 Week One, The Thames River","id":"636706468116037642","name":"🛥-the-submersible-tir-na-nog","position":200,"server_id":"636012145204527125","topic":null,"type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/roanoke-season-3/roanoke-season-3.sqlite","database_sha256":"16d47fa7c4f38d18670fc7fc2639614b0b61c31f716d8e6ecba86f1f87412b4d","project_ids":["roanoke-s3"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-01T23:13:18Z","id":"636012145204527125","name":"Roanoke Season 3"},"server_slug":"roanoke-season-3"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"Baeshra looks out over the city. \"London much wierd. Baeshra only stay few days. But Baeshra long way from home too.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:01:26.814000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736463103990038569","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"HA! Yes indeed.\" He tries to grin, but it falters as he grips the edge of the boat.","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:02:33.734000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736463384672993354","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"Hard at first. Always miss home. Miss less after time. But yeti can always come home.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:04:23.119000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736463843466674217","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"London was the first cornerstone I carved after leaving Nepal. I can guide her no more. \"BUT! I have a slab of granite ready to be the cornersone of the new world.\"He pauses for a moment. \"It is a big responsibility, carving out a path that others will tread long after I am gone. I have many decisions to make and the wrong ones can lead to catastrophe.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:07:25.010000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736464606373085214","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"I must decided what sort of building it will be.\" he thinks out loud.","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:08:27.548000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736464868676206642","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"Cats trophy? Cat not great hunt... is cats trophy bad?\" She asks thinking of Grimmlock","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:09:17.977000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736465080190894081","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"My master Hiram tried to set one as the Mayors house in old Roanoke. He believed that the key to the future lay in governance. But I am longer sure...\" He smiles at Baeshra's mispronunciation. Perhaps the heart of the people need to be cared for, not in a temple or in a seat of political power. But something closer to home. To the heart.","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:10:45.645000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-25T06:11:11.228000Z","id":"736465447897268295","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"Key to future?\" Baeshra asks thinking hard.","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:11:53.131000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736465730954067988","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"The people are wild. And after 400 years. I am old and I wonder if I am the right person to go. I wish it were Hiram. He was wiser, than I. He did not seek new recruits. He was able to bare the burdens and the weight of the secrets to come on his own. I fear that I am not able.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:13:50.609000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-25T06:14:19.136000Z","id":"736466223692513332","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"All people wild. Row kanok. London. Even Baeshra home. No change that. Yeti Master take task  alone, and not successful in hunt. Yeti find friends, Leaf. Wren. Much more. How yeti fail at hunt. Much aid.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:17:49.696000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736467226496073770","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"You're right Baeshra.\" he tries again, and this time the grin is thick. \"Perhaps as we grow together through the trials to come... Have you ever known Hunger Baeshra?\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:22:44.098000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736468461307560018","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"Yes. Baeshra always hungry","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:23:50.468000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736468739683385404","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"There is something that is also always hungers. Something I fear. Something that has laid waste to the two previous colonies.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:25:47.754000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736469231616524340","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"Apex? Baeshra hunt. Baeshra will be new apex.\" She nods firmly.","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:26:40.257000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736469451830198364","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"Yes Baeshra. Your bravery. It is known. But this is a thing. A thing that hungers to unmake us. A thing that in it's presence warps all manner of beasts into aberrations. Cruel and false copies of the natural way.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:28:46.641000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736469981922852894","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"Web appears from a nearby sewer, grinning. Seeing Baeshra talking to the archivist they quietly go to sit nearby, not wishing to disturb them.","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:29:20.841000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736470125368180786","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"Hmm...Baeshra make Yeti feel safe. Baeshra hunt Aoex. Then hunt apex line.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:30:26.343000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736470400103481345","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"Come Anansi kin. You are welcome here too, we outcasts and monster are warmed by the starlight and your silk will soon find its way into the Above of the wood.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:31:02.150000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736470550289055796","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"<@!260820438026813440>","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:31:34.520000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736470686058414170","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"Anansi? I'm sorry, I didn't want to intrude.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:31:57.120000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736470780849684571","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"A spider I knew once in Egypt. You remind me of him. And of the barbary coast.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:32:36.239000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736470944926793760","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"Web Spider God. Spider god help against thing. Protect Row Kanok.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:33:04.488000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736471063411687435","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"Web smiles at this. \"I am glad I remind you of such a notable creature,\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:33:16.466000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736471113651060816","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"I don't believe we've formally met, by the way. I'm Web.\" Web sticks out a hand.","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:34:02.972000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736471308711493704","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"Anansi knew 1000 stories and was a God too, in his own fashion. For none of the animal Gods could speak his stories. I know you web. As I know all of London. I set her cornerstone and carved the runes in the rock that let you live in the under. You too could learn the stories that that no one else knows. I've seen you leading and making your life known.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:35:53.140000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-25T06:36:12.540000Z","id":"736471770789576774","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"Web cocks their head at this. \"I did not realize you were that old, kind sir. Nor did I realize you had been watching me. What should I call you, then?\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:37:52.275000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736472270477721621","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"I am Llywellyn Ap of the Raven and stone. I am he who whose temple lies at the base of the mountain in Shangri LA. A monster who tamed himself to read. To learn of the world. The wandering path of the spice traders roads filled my feet with 10,000 miles of people and cities each with their own secret knowlege of how to come together. Setting their path and moving on. But foundations wear down, and there are no longer enough tinkers to mend the foundations. We can only set the way. But You may call me Daysong. I am the Archivist. The record keeper. Of the Roseline.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:43:55.387000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736473793479966841","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"Oh, you are the archivist! Leaf speaks very highly of you.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T06:44:33.346000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736473952691552330","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
